OL,3,GNEWSA'Not my job to set a budget,' says
OL,4,Asecretary of state
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Northern Ireland secretary has said
OL,7,Fthat it is not his "job" to set a
OL,8,Fbudget and that it is the
OL,9,Fresponsibility of the Northern Ireland
OL,10,FExecutive.
OL,12,FThis comes after no resolution was
OL,13,Freached in negotiations between
OL,14,Fexecutive parties and Sir Chris Bryant.
OL,16,FHe is understood to have presented a
OL,17,Fset of conditions, including revenue
OL,18,Fraising, to be attached to any
OL,19,Fpotential deal on a Stormont budget.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
